# Normalize line endings in the repository, not in each developer's environment.
# Git stores LF in every blob; without this file a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF in the working tree, which makes the Prettier
# gate (endOfLine: "lf") fail on files that are correct in Git.
# See sdd/formatting/spec.md (FR-003).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the eol conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
